{"id":"525f810b84880b72","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md","title":"一致固定点剖面的单点刻画","display":"thm-stable-sentence-characterization — 一致固定点剖面的单点刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization","aliases":["91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization","91-thm-stable-char"],"display":"thm-stable-sentence-characterization — 一致固定点剖面的单点刻画","depends_on":["[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","[[91-df-unstable-sentence]]","[[91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization</span><span>91-thm-stable-char</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-stable-sentence-characterization — 一致固定点剖面的单点刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3a19d5715745463a\" href=\"?note=3a19d5715745463a\" title=\"91-df-stable-sentence\">91-df-stable-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6b350e567d372da0\" href=\"?note=6b350e567d372da0\" title=\"91-df-unstable-sentence\">91-df-unstable-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"da74a4922b7a5745\" href=\"?note=da74a4922b7a5745\" title=\"91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification\">91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> (非空一致固定点类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> (固定点真值)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\{v_\\Gamma(\\varphi):\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\{v_\\Gamma(\\varphi):\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\}\\)</span> (真值剖面)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\\)</span> (见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3a19d5715745463a\" href=\"?note=3a19d5715745463a\" title=\"91-df-stable-sentence\">91-df-stable-sentence</a> 的稳定性谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}stable\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left|\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\right|=1\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}stable\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left|\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\right|=1\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>剖面分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathbf t\\}\">\\(\\{\\mathbf t\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathbf f\\}\">\\(\\{\\mathbf f\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(\\{\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> 时，句子\n稳定真、稳定假、稳定 gap；任何含两个或三个值的剖面都表示固定点依赖。</p>\n<p>从基础算术句开始并在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>、否定、联结词和量词下闭合，可得到一类\ngrounded 稳定句，但这只是充分生成法，不是全部稳定句的递归刻画。\n例如说谎者是稳定 gap，却不是按原文件的 grounded 递归从基础句生成；\n真理陈述者则固定点依赖，而不是在 Kripke 阶段中振荡。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-stable-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3a19d5715745463a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-unstable-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"6b350e567d372da0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-unstable-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification","status":"resolved","id":"da74a4922b7a5745","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-stable-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3a19d5715745463a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)$ (见 [[91-df-stable-sentence]] 的稳定性谓词)","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\{v_\\Gamma(\\varphi):\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}stable\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left|\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\right|=1\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\{\\mathbf t\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\mathbf f\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1670,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-149","locations